Does purple carry a measurable effect for a brand
title end

section start
title start
Abstract
title end
paragraph start
Question: does purple carry a measurable effect for a brand. Method: the reviews read for any finding on purple. Result: no solid evidence was found in this round. Limit: the primary brand personality paper, which tested hue, was not read in full, so purple results may exist there.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Introduction
title end
paragraph start
Purple is a possible second accent, so this page records what is known about it.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Methods
title end
paragraph start
Searched the reviews and summaries for findings on purple.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Results
title end
paragraph start
The sources read in this round did not report findings on purple. Hue was one of the three parts of colour tested in brand personality studies, but the purple results were not retrieved.
paragraph end
section end

section start
title start
Discussion
title end
paragraph start
Purple stays a design choice with no evidence behind it. It can be used, but not defended with research yet.
paragraph end
paragraph start
